  "compatibilityPromises": [
    "Unclassified callers, the cloud record, workspace, billing, and app bootstrap code may continue importing authentication internals during inventory; imports from classified domains remain subject to cross-domain rules.",
    "authStore, useCurrentUser, apiKeyAuthStore, and userStore remain the app-wide identity seams; authStore stays a projection over the account-package identity and pushes nothing into the session client.",
    "workspaceAuthStore keeps constructing the session client with the package Firebase identity, and the legacy workspace-token rail remains until the unified_cloud_auth flag retires it.",
    "Balance, customer, and credit-purchase calls still living in authStore, usePartnerNodesRunGate living under platform/billing/composables, and stores or composables that open dialogs or call scripts/api remain untracked responsibility and coupling debt; classification does not grant dependency exceptions."
  ],
  "deepImports": "inventory"
